<title>UK: UK meals/feeds follow lower Chicago lead.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds follow lower Chicago lead.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sellers lowered high protein soymeal prices by one to two stg a tonne on the UK meals and feeds market on Wednesday following the easier overnight close in Chicago.</p>
<p>Traders were unable to confirm any business but they reported talk of a &quot;fair amount&quot; of business being done on the east coast for soymeal.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
